cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "ChIPBindVis: One-command publication-ready ChIP-seq binding visualization at target gene promoters"
abstract: >-
  ChIPBindVis is an R package providing one-command, publication-ready
  ChIP-seq binding visualization at target gene promoters. Given a bigWig
  signal file and a narrowPeak (or broadPeak) file, it produces (A) a Gviz
  genome-browser track centered on a target gene's TSS and (B) a strand-aware
  EnrichedHeatmap across all peak-annotated target gene TSSs, with the
  query gene highlighted. Supports human (hg38, hg19) and mouse (mm10, mm39)
  reference assemblies.
